        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "action"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are wielding a shield.</p><hr /><p>Attacks with your shield knock the sense out of your foes. Make a shield bash, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Shield Boss], or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Shield Spikes] Strike. If you hit and deal damage, the target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stupefied]{Stupefied 1} until the start of your next turn (@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stupefied]{Stupefied 2} on a critical hit). If your shield is a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Tower Shield], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Fortress Shield], or another shield that grants a higher circumstance bonus to AC when you @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Take Cover] behind it, the creature is instead stupefied 2 if you hit and deal damage to it (@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stupefied]{Stupefied 3} on a critical hit).</p>"
          },
